# Recruiter Lens

## 6-second scan test
Recruiter must instantly see: Software Engineer, React/Node, based in Italy, 2+ years relevant dev.

## Positioning
- Primary: Full-Stack JavaScript Engineer
- Differentiator: SCADA/energy background (for industrial/energy roles only)
- Avoid: Leading with "operator" or "WordPress designer"

## Application strategy
1. Tailor CV keywords to each job description
2. Cover letter: 3 paragraphs max — why company, why role, why Italy/EU
3. Track in `knowledge/target-companies.md`
4. Prefer referrals over cold applications

## Screening questions to prepare
- Work authorization: Permesso di soggiorno — authorized to work in Italy
- Salary: flexible — always ask their range first
- Modalidad: indifferent (remote/hybrid/onsite); relocation within Italy OK
- Availability: immediate — no defined notice period at SEIDOR
- English B2 / Italian A1 (learning)

## Rejection patterns to preempt
- "Junior for mid role" → emphasize SEIDOR enterprise + portfolio
- "SCADA not relevant" → pivot to full-stack; mention SCADA only if job fits
